window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They've found the other lost children, but that win came at a price. On the run, Lena, Flint and their family know they have two options: go back into hiding or fight.</p> <p></p> <p>Will their abilities be strong enough to ensure their freedom? Or will Lena and Flint's greatest fear finally come true?</p> <p></p> <p>Don't miss out on book three in this captivating YA Science Fantasy series. Download now!</p>"; 
